  "title": "Cedar Plank-Smoked Salmon",
  "description": "Salmon is a delicate fish that tastes great when lightly smoked. Cooking it on a cedar plank over a live fire gives it a great smoky flavor while letting it hold its shape.",
  "authors": [
    "Bush Cook"
  ],
